Word - a word processor that reads Microsoft Word files
=======================================================

!Word, in the MoreApps directory on the hard disc, is the start of a
word processor for Microsoft Word documents (.docx files). This
version opens a Word document, shows its text with the formatting it
uses, lets you select text, type and delete text with undo and redo,
format it (bold, sizes, colours, alignment, indents...) from the keys,
a Format menu, a toolbar and a ruler, see it larger or smaller, shows
the numbers and bullets of its lists and keeps them right as you
edit, and saves it, losing nothing: back to its file, under another
name, or as a copy. Click its icon for a new document; recent files
are on its menu. It copies, cuts and pastes, and finds and replaces
text (section 4); page layout and printing come in later versions
(see section 13).

It is written in JavaScript, and it is all on the disc: you can read
it (and change it) in !JsEdit, like the programs in the Programming
guide.

